            .project-details__opportunity-wrapper
                .container
                    .columns.is-variable.is-6
                        .column.is-4
                            %p.eyebrow Define
                            %h2 The Opportunity
                        .column.is-8
                            %p.projects__middle-text
                                Badia typically limited their brand activations to a handful of major holidays, leaving long stretches of the year with minimal presence beyond the shelf. The real opportunity was a platform, something that could give Badia a consistent, ongoing presence to build brand awareness year round while still flexing to support the holiday moments they already invested in.
            .project-details__routes-wrapper
                .container
                    .columns.is-variable.is-6
                        .column.is-3
                            %p.eyebrow Ideate
                            %h2 Two Creative Routes
                        .column.is-8.is-offset-1
                            %p.projects__middle-text
                                Instead of settling on one tone right away, we deliberately pushed to two extremes: one rational and full of attitude, one purely emotional. "Métele Sazón" leaned into boldness and everyday language. "El Sabor Nos Une" leaned into connection and memory. Exploring both ends gave Badia two strong, distinct options to choose from rather than one safe middle ground.
