                                            .routes__title
                                                El sabor nos une
                                            .routes__translation
                                                The flavor that unites us
                                            .routes__description 
                                                A tribute to shared meals and memory, positioning Badia as the flavor behind the moments people gather around.
            .project-details__description-wrapper
