                            %h2 Offline
                        .column.is-8
                            %p.projects__middle-text
                                Billboards carried both creative routes into everyday spaces, catching people on their commute with a message short and punchy enough to register at a glance. Given how little time drivers actually have to read anything, each execution leaned on bold typography, the shared color palette, and a single line of copy to do all the work.
