                        .column.is-4
                            %p.eyebrow Strategy
                            %h2 PR Box
                        .column.is-8
                            %p.projects__middle-text
                                The PR box was a tactical activation designed to let influencers and media live the seasonal concept in their own kitchens rather than just read about it. Each box adapted its storytelling to whichever route it represented and whatever moment it was tied to, so a Thanksgiving box, for example, came with the spices needed to make turkey and the line "El pavo no nació para ser soso" (turkey wasn't born to be bland). Inside, a curated family of Badia products paired with a branded towel, apron, and oven mitts, everyday kitchen tools that kept the brand present long after the box was opened, turning cooking itself into an ongoing touchpoint with the campaign.
